--- 3.2.0 2026/11/20

Changes for updated v3.2.0 specifications:

008-bf2marc
    Added mapping of new 008/21 codes for continuing resources.

Instance-bf2marc
    Changed creation of $5; code is taken from URI in Item bf:heldBy resource since bflc:applicableInstitution resources are no longer created.

Item-bf2marc
    Added conversion of variant title resources.
    Changed creation of $5; code is taken from URI in bf:heldBy resource since bflc:applicableInstitution resources are no longer created.

Work-bf2marc
    Editorial cleanup to convert bf:musicMedium resources.
    Added creation of 341 $h.
    Refined creation of 700-730 second indicator based on contents of bf:relationship URIs.
    Changed creation of $5; code is taken from URI in Item bf:heldBy resource since bflc:applicableInstitution resources are no longer created.
    Added creation of L/07="b" and "d" codes and refined data output in MARC 334 field based on changes in Official RDA.

Process0-4
    Updated creation of 856 field in Process 4 to add default indicator values.


